<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $82-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $82-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened $1-1/4 up at $82-5/8 in New York on Tuesday and soon rose $0-3/8 further to $83.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 454.9 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
